Package: blighter-child
Version: 1.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: squid, openssh-server, nftables, dconf-cli, sudo, python3
Maintainer: Ian <ianp5@pm.me>
Description: Blighter Restrictor - child PC component
 Lets the Blighter Restrictor parent app manage web filtering on this
 PC over the home network.  Installs a restricted root helper, a
 child-only firewall that forces web traffic through Squid, and a setup
 command.  After installing run:  sudo blighter-setup <child-username>
